          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"services.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Therapies • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg1:#0f1724;--bg2:#071029;--accent:#88d3c8;--accent-2:#b39be0;--muted:#cbd5e1;--card:#0b1220}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial; color:var(--muted);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    header{position:sticky;top:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(7,16,41,0.6),transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);z-index:40;padding:18px 28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#071029;font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a.active{color:white;font-weight:600}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px}\\n\\n    /* pattern as a floating SVG element */\\n    .bg-svg{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.14;mix-blend-mode:screen}\\n\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:26px}\\n    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:34px;border-radius:14px}\\n    h1{color:white;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.05}\\n    p.lead{margin:0;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.78)}\\n    .aside{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(136,211,200,0.06),rgba(179,155,224,0.04));padding:20px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px}\\n\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .card h3{margin:0;color:white;font-size:16px}\\n    .card p{margin:8px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4}\\n\\n    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}\\n    .btn{padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}\\n    .btn.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#071029}\\n    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .testimonials{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .quote{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(11,18,32,0.6),rgba(11,18,32,0.4));padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:32px;padding:28px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{padding:18px}.bg-svg{opacity:0.08}}    \\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <!-- decorative SVG background unique to this page -->\\n  <svg class=\\\"bg-svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 1600 900\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid slice\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#88d3c8\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#b39be0\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n      <filter id=\\\"blur\\\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"40\\\"/></filter>\\n      <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" fill=\\\"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"30\\\" cy=\\\"30\\\" r=\\\"2\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.04\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"170\\\" cy=\\\"170\\\" r=\\\"2\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.04\\\"/>\\n      </pattern>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\" />\\n    <g filter=\\\"url(#blur)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\">\\n      <path d=\\\"M-200 200 C200 10,420 -30,800 120 C1180 270,1500 140,1800 220 L1800 900 L-200 900 Z\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.17\\\"/>\\n      <path d=\\\"M-200 400 C100 300,420 260,760 340 C1100 420,1420 360,1800 430 L1800 900 L-200 900 Z\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.02\\\"/>\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">HM</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:white;font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"active\\\" href=\\\"services.html\\\">Therapies</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Method</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Therapies & modalities</div>\\n        <h1>Gentle, evidence-minded options to support the whole person</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">We offer a layered toolkit—herbal care, nutrition, movement, and coaching—applied with clinical reasoning and respect for your individuality. Recommendations are educational and tailored, not promises of cure.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Ask a question</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"aside\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:white\\\">Session formats</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">60–90 min initial consultations • 30–45 min follow-ups • Virtual and in-person by appointment in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:white\\\">Practitioner</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"height:8px\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">For urgent medical concerns, seek immediate care. Our work focuses on education, prevention, and supportive therapies.</div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:0;color:white\\\">Core services — a layered approach</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">Choose one path or combine them; we coordinate care.</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Integrative Consultation</h3>\\n          <p>Comprehensive intake, health history synthesis, and shared goal-setting to create a gentle, evidence-informed plan.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Herbal Medicine & Botanicals</h3>\\n          <p>Plant-based supports chosen for safety, interactions, and individualized needs. Education on expected benefits and limits.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Nutritional Guidance</h3>\\n          <p>Food-first strategies, meal patterns, and targeted nutrient support to improve energy, digestion, and sleep.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Mind-Body Coaching</h3>\\n          <p>Practical methods for stress regulation: breathing, movement, ritual, and cognitive reframing to build resilience.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Sleep & Circadian Support</h3>\\n          <p>Behavioral recommendations and environmental tuning to reclaim restorative sleep—no unrealistic promises, just practical steps.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3>Gut Health & Functional Nutrition</h3>\\n          <p>Digestive symptom management through food, timing, and educational elimination/reintroduction where indicated.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"color:white\\\">How we combine them</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">Each plan is built from small experiments. We emphasize measurable changes, tracking, and revision—so you learn what helps you, not what should fix everyone.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px\\\">\\n          <h3>Personalized blends</h3>\\n          <p>Herbal and nutritional recommendations are matched to your history and medications; we prioritize safety and clarity.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px\\\">\\n          <h3>Education & self-care</h3>\\n          <p>Each visit includes practical steps and short lessons so you can steward your health between visits.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"color:white\\\">Voices & outcomes</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"testimonials\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\n          \\\"I finally understand my sleep pattern. The guidance was gentle and realistic—small shifts, steady results.\\\" — A client in {{CITY}}\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"quote\\\">\\n          \\\"Herbal supports were explained clearly alongside my meds. I felt listened to and informed every step.\\\" — Anonymous\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:26px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:white\\\">Ready to begin?</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">Schedule an initial consult to map a sustainable plan. Virtual or in-person.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Call: {{PHONE}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Appointments prioritize safety and shared decision-making; no cure claims are made.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"conditions.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Concerns • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#071029;--card:#071621;--accent:#e6c6ff;--muted:#cbd5e1}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial;color:var(--muted);background:radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 20%, rgba(179,155,224,0.08), transparent), linear-gradient(180deg,#04121b,#071029);min-height:100vh}\\n    header{padding:18px 26px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#88d3c8,#b39be0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#071029;font-weight:800}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:16px}\\n    nav a.active{color:#fff}\\n    .container{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:20px}\\n    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    h1{color:white;margin:0 0 6px 0}\\n    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:16px}\\n    .issue{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.015),transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .issue h3{margin:0;color:#fff;font-size:15px}\\n    .issue p{margin:8px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .note{margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n    footer{margin-top:22px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* unique subtle pattern in page */\\n    .pattern{position:absolute;right:-120px;top:-40px;opacity:0.12;pointer-events:none}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:760px){.container{padding:14px}.pattern{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" width=\\\"420\\\" height=\\\"420\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 420 420\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"cg\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#88d3c8\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#b39be0\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n    </defs>\\n    <g opacity=\\\"0.95\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\">\\n      <circle cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"80\\\" r=\\\"90\\\" fill=\\\"url(#cg)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.18\\\"/>\\n      <rect x=\\\"180\\\" y=\\\"160\\\" width=\\\"180\\\" height=\\\"180\\\" rx=\\\"24\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.02\\\"/>\\n      <path d=\\\"M40 360 C120 260,300 240,380 320\\\" stroke=\\\"#ffffff\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.02\\\" stroke-width=\\\"22\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">HM</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:white;font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Start</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"active\\\" href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Conditions</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">What's Offered</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Our Process</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Pricing</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Reach Out</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <h1>Common concerns we support</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"lead\\\">We center education and whole-person context. The items below reflect areas where gentle, stepwise interventions often help. These are not guaranteed outcomes; individual responses vary and medical evaluation may be necessary.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"issue\\\">\\n          <h3>Stress & Anxiety</h3>\\n          <p>Techniques to regulate the nervous system, pacing plans, supportive botanicals, and cognitive tools to reduce reactivity and improve functioning.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"issue\\\">\\n          <h3>Sleep disturbances</h3>\\n          <p>Behavioral sleep hygiene, circadian alignment, and non-addictive supports to improve sleep quality; we discuss medication interactions and expectations.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"issue\\\">\\n          <h3>Digestive complaints</h3>\\n          <p>Food pattern adjustments, timing, and targeted nutrition for bloating, irregularity, or discomfort, with guidance for when further testing is needed.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"issue\\\">\\n          <h3>Chronic inflammation & pain</h3>\\n          <p>Lifestyle, nutritional, and botanical strategies to support inflammatory balance and functional capacity—education about limits and safety first.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"issue\\\">\\n          <h3>Low energy & fatigue</h3>\\n          <p>Root-cause exploration, sleep and nutrition alignment, and small tests of change to rebuild sustainable energy across weeks and months.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"note\\\">\\n        <strong>Important:</strong> This page is educational. We do not offer guaranteed cures. If you have a serious or urgent medical condition, please seek immediate medical attention. Recommendations are individualized and consider medications, labs, and other providers.\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"max-width:640px\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:0;color:white\\\">How we respond</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\">We begin with listening and create plans built from small experiments and measurement. We coordinate with your medical team where appropriate.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#88d3c8,#b39be0);color:#071029;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\">Book an intake</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"color:white\\\">Questions we often get</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:white\\\">Will herbs interfere with my meds?</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">We review interactions and prioritize safety; some combinations are contraindicated, so we tailor carefully.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:white\\\">How soon will I notice change?</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Small shifts can appear in days for sleep and weeks for appetite or mood; complex issues may take months. We set reasonable expectations together.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • Clinical guidance focused on education and partnership. Contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{PHONE}}</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Our Way of Working • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#08111b;--panel:#071223;--accent1:#88d3c8;--accent2:#b39be0;--muted:#cbd5e1}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;color:var(--muted);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#051020,var(--bg));min-height:100vh}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 26px}\\n    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent1),var(--accent2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#071029;font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{margin-left:16px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    nav a.active{color:white}\\n    .main{max-width:980px;margin:36px auto;padding:20px}\\n    .lead-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:22px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    h1{color:white;margin:0}\\n    .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:16px}\\n    .step{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n    .step .num{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent1),var(--accent2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#071029;font-weight:800}\\n    .step h3{margin:0;color:white;font-size:15px}\\n    .foot{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .cta{margin-top:18px}\\n    .btn{padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}\\n    .primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent1),var(--accent2));color:#071029}\\n\\n    /* unique, minimal dotted SVG pattern */\\n    .pattern{position:fixed;left:12px;bottom:12px;opacity:0.08;pointer-events:none}\\n\\n    @media (min-width:880px){.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" width=\\\"260\\\" height=\\\"260\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 260 260\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"ag2\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#88d3c8\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#b39be0\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n    <g fill=\\\"url(#ag2)\\\">\\n      <circle cx=\\\"40\\\" cy=\\\"40\\\" r=\\\"2\\\" opacity=\\\"0.25\\\"/>\\n      <circle cx=\\\"80\\\" cy=\\\"20\\\" r=\\\"1.4\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n      <circle cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"60\\\" r=\\\"1.8\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n      <circle cx=\\\"200\\\" cy=\\\"200\\\" r=\\\"2\\\" opacity=\\\"0.08\\\"/>\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">HM</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:white;font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Begin</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Services</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"active\\\" href=\\\"approach.html\\\">How We Work</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"main\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"lead-card\\\">\\n      <h1>Our process: deliberate, transparent, and collaborative</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"foot\\\">We prioritize listening, education, and measurable steps. Below is how a typical partnership unfolds; recommendations are educational and individualized.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"steps\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"num\\\">1</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h3>Intake & story-gathering</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"foot\\\">A thorough conversation about history, current concerns, medications, and goals. We document patterns and identify safety considerations and priorities.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"num\\\">2</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h3>Co-created plan</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"foot\\\">We propose a layered, time-bound plan: small experiments, lifestyle adjustments, possible botanical or nutritional supports, and clear metrics to track.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"num\\\">3</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h3>Optional labs (educational)</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"foot\\\">If indicated, we discuss labs as tools to inform choices—bloodwork, metabolic panels, or specific functional tests—with emphasis on when they change management.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"num\\\">4</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h3>Follow-ups & adjustment</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"foot\\\">Short follow-ups to review outcomes, tweak doses, and refine behaviors. We favor small, sustainable changes and iterative learning over one-time fixes.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"num\\\">5</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h3>Coordination & referral</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"foot\\\">When your needs exceed our scope, we collaborate with your medical team or refer to specialists. Safety and transparency guide decisions.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"num\\\">6</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h3>Transition to self-directed care</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"foot\\\">The goal is to empower you with skills and a plan you can maintain, with periodic check-ins as needed. Ongoing care is available but not obligatory.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"foot\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:white\\\">Want to talk through the process?</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"foot\\\">We welcome questions about safety, interactions, and realistic timelines before booking.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:8px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">Contact: {{PHONE}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:26px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center\\\">\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}. Clinical care emphasizes education, risk awareness, and whole-person context; no guaranteed cures are offered.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
      ],
      "role": "assistant"
